#TODO: Update the unit test with new Scenario
Feature: Update Policy

  Background:
    Given a Resource Type for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ",
         "name": "FAQ",
         "description": "FAQ",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "tags": [
            "tag1",
            "tag2"
         ]
      }
      """
    And a Scope for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "scopeKey": "policy_scope"
      }
      """
    And a Policy for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "ADMIN-U1"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: update Policy with all required fields.
    Given the Resource Admin with API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' wants to update the Policy key 'FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY' with the following attributes:
      """json
      {
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin Update",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "USER-1"
         ],
         "effect": "DENY"
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin updates the Policy
    Then the Policy updated successfully with response code 200
    And return the updated Policy
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin Update",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "USER-1"
         ],
         "effect": "DENY"
      }
      """

